menu "Step Engine (GPTimer ISR pulse generator)"

config STEP_ENGINE_SELF_TEST
    bool "Run step-engine self-test on boot"
    default n
    help
        When enabled, the firmware runs all step-engine unit tests
        during startup (after BSP init, before protocol stack).
        Results printed via ESP_LOG, final summary line:
        "SELF-TEST DONE: <n>/<total> PASS" (tag: step_selftest).

        Tests cover: step count accuracy, period accuracy,
        immediate stop, queue behavior, direction change,
        very low speed (chain-wait), direction inversion,
        and ISR execution time measurement.

        For on-target verification only.  Keep disabled in
        production firmware.

endmenu
